# Normalize line endings: every text file is stored in the repository with LF.
# Without this, Windows checkouts may convert files to CRLF and produce diffs
# that change every line, plus conflicts with `ruff format`.
* text=auto eol=lf
 
# Windows scripts must keep CRLF to run correctly.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
 
# Binary files: never touch their bytes (e.g. KAT test vectors, images, PDFs).
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary